    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/c7d2d4167ea8f692184d679cd952812f.avif?t=1753271964\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hawaiian shirt, ripped sleeves, sunglasses, a true winner\u2019s tan, swept back gold and a rad stache. MOTOSCAFO is a man hard as a fossil cookie. He knows no fear when he\u2019s on a speedboat.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOTOSCAFO is the hero that takes on injustice, with no worry for consequences: he\u2019s the swag seafarer that fights Moneybags, Freebooters and Monstroni, for what good is left in the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOSTIA BAY NEEDS YOU!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/b95f224d222ea5ad2642346e9882abaf.poster.avif?t=1753271964\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/b95f224d222ea5ad2642346e9882abaf.webm?t=1753271964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/b95f224d222ea5ad2642346e9882abaf.mp4?t=1753271964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When trouble's afoot in the bay, <strong>Hostia News</strong>\u00a0makes sure it'll be known! Check the articles, and bring MOTOSCAFO's help where is needed!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHICA CHICA BOOM!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/28c42baefd60def0c726420ebf09637b.poster.avif?t=1753271964\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/28c42baefd60def0c726420ebf09637b.webm?t=1753271964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/28c42baefd60def0c726420ebf09637b.mp4?t=1753271964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your speedboat loadout at <strong>Motore's</strong>\u00a0and get ready to save the day, MOTOSCAFO style!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE</strong>\u00a0<strong>THE HERO OF ROOSTER SKULL ISLAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/6f1d40ea9595fab0aed57a2bca8c2130.poster.avif?t=1753271964\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/6f1d40ea9595fab0aed57a2bca8c2130.webm?t=1753271964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/6f1d40ea9595fab0aed57a2bca8c2130.mp4?t=1753271964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look out for secret passages and hidden resources,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/c3c63adc70362c631bb705940064c81f.poster.avif?t=1753271964\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/c3c63adc70362c631bb705940064c81f.webm?t=1753271964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/c3c63adc70362c631bb705940064c81f.mp4?t=1753271964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons, improve your speedboat and get ready for a fight:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/81f00bd4e684b489713b5a979fe16160.poster.avif?t=1753271964\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/81f00bd4e684b489713b5a979fe16160.webm?t=1753271964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/81f00bd4e684b489713b5a979fe16160.mp4?t=1753271964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >monsters, marauders or moneybags, nothing and no one can stop MOTOSCAFO!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/7ca9c3a729c0b4919cef96fba31c7652.avif?t=1753271964\" width=922 height=1045 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s weird. It\u2019s fun. It\u2019s MOTOSCAFO!</p>",
